# Weight profile flint-exl3-4.0: Recursive's Flint in our EXL3 pack at 4.0 bpw: every projection at 4 bits, head 5
# (exllamav3 1.6.2 + our Flint architecture, mul1 codebook; the routed experts' up projections stored divided by 128;
# 20.6 GB), from RecursiveSI/flint at revision 2a247be0. Against BF16 (8 held-out rows x 1,024): KL 0.160, top-1
# 80.5 %, ppl 31.65 against 29.88. Measured on the Spark (2026-10-22, SPD-145/144, one request): plain decode 133.5-134.2
# tok/s (512 greedy tokens), 101.7 at 16k, 61.0 at 64k, 39.5 at 128k, 23.0 at 256k; with the lookup up to 480.0 tok/s on
# a copy ask and 149.5 on a 2,048-token game file; prefill 5,375 tok/s at 4,096 tokens, 2,262 at 128k; 19.25 GiB at
# load. The pack is public, pinned by commit.
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh flint-exl3-4.0.
QSE_FLINT_VARIANT=exl3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Flint-EXL3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=a04d4b957e27f490c1f940b3126c0e4b3e47ddb7
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=20.6
# the engine's limits: the load (19.3 allocated) + the KV at 262,144 tokens (7.2) + the graphs and attention partials of
# the context classes, with room for the caches (end anchors, park, store); peak: the ceiling + a 4,096-token prefill
# chunk's workspace at 256k (27.6 GiB allocated measured at 256k, no caches)
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=56
MEM_CEILING_GIB=40
MEM_PEAK_GIB=46
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_flint.env"
